//! # Ambient Audio System
//!
//! Atmospheric background audio for horror atmosphere.
//! Manages layered ambient loops that respond to game state.
//!
//! ## Ambient Layers
//!
//! ```
//! ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
//! │                    AMBIENT STACK                             │
//! ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
//! │  [Reality Layer]  Distortion/static based on perception     │
//! │  [Weather]        Rain, wind, thunder                        │
//! │  [Scene]          Location-specific (church creaks, etc)     │
//! │  [Tension]        Heartbeat, breathing (stress response)     │
//! │  [Base]           Core ambient bed (night sounds, etc)       │
//! └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
//! ```

use super::{AudioAsset, AudioChannel, AudioId};
use crate::system::RealityLayer;
use std::collections::HashMap;

